  <p id="c-liangshu-033-liuhui-grandfather:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuhui-grandfather:p001:m0000" ref="di1_zqb_t0f">劉孝綽</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuhui-grandfather:p001:m0004" ref="di1_zqb_t0f">孝綽</persName>，彭城人，本名<persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuhui-grandfather:p001:m0013" ref="di1_zqb_t0f">冉</persName>。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuhui-grandfather:p001:m0016" ref="e2r_5iw_ui0_A">勔</persName>，宋司空忠昭公。父<persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuhui-grandfather:p001:m0026" ref="e2r_5iw_ui0_AA">繪</persName>，齊大司馬霸府從事中郎。</p>
